 "lines": [
  [
   "P1",
   "Title: Locale Isomorphism is Isomorphism in Loc"
  ],
  [
   "P2",
   "Let $\\mathbf{Loc}$ denote the [[Definition:Category of Locales|category of locales]]."
  ],
  [
   "P3",
   "Let $L_1 = \\struct{S_1, \\preceq_1}$ and $L_2 = \\struct{S_2, \\preceq_2}$ be [[Definition:Locale (Lattice Theory)|locales]]."
  ],
  [
   "P4",
   "Let $f:S_1 \\to S_2$ be a [[Definition:Continuous Map (Locale)|continuous map]] of $\\mathbf{Loc}$."
  ],
  [
   "P5",
   "Then:"
  ],
  [
   "P6",
   ":$f$ is an [[Definition:Isomorphism|isomorphism]] of $\\mathbf{Loc}$ {{iff}} $f$ is a [[Definition:Locale Isomorphism|locale isomorphism]]."
  ],
  [
   1,
   "By definition of [[Definition:Category of Locales|category of locales]]:"
  ],
  [
   2,
   ":$\\mathbf{Loc}$ is the [[Definition:Dual Category|dual category]] of the [[Definition:Category of Frames|category of frames]] $\\mathbf{Frm}$"
  ],
  [
   3,
   ""
  ],
  [
   4,
   "From [[Isomorphism iff Isomorphism in Dual Category]]:"
  ],
  [
   5,
   ":$f$ is an [[Definition:Isomorphism (Category Theory)|isomorphism]] of $\\mathbf{Loc}$"
  ],
  [
   6,
   "{{iff}}:"
  ],
  [
   7,
   ":$f = h^{\\text{op}}$ for some [[Definition:Isomorphism (Category Theory)|isomorphism]] $h$ in $\\mathbf{Frm}$"
  ],
  [
   8,
   ""
  ],
  [
   9,
   "From [[Frame Isomorphism is Isomorphism in Category Frm]]:"
  ],
  [
   10,
   ":$h$ is an [[Definition:Isomorphism (Category Theory)|isomorphism]] in $\\mathbf{Frm}$"
  ],
  [
   11,
   "{{iff}}:"
  ],
  [
   12,
   ":$h$ is a [[Definition:Frame Isomorphism|frame isomorphism]]"
  ],
  [
   13,
   ""
  ],
  [
   14,
   "By definition of [[Definition:Locale Isomorphism|locale isomorphism]]:"
  ],
  [
   15,
   ":$f$ is a [[Definition:Locale Isomorphism|locale isomorphism]]"
  ],
  [
   16,
   "{{iff}}:"
  ],
  [
   17,
   ":$f = h^{\\text{op}}$ for some [[Definition:Frame Homomorphism|frame homomorphism]]"
  ],
  [
   18,
   ""
  ],
  [
   19,
   "The result follows."
  ],
  [
   20,
   "{{qed}}"
  ],
  [
   21,
   ""
  ],
  [
   22,
   "[[Category:Locales]]"
  ]
 ],
